{
  "_about": "Where the themes' interface sounds are looked for (docs/THEMES.md, Les sons). scripts/sound_library.py downloads each source into tmp/sound-library/, checks its archive against sha256 and lists its sounds in the catalogue the sound bench plays; a sound's id is '<title> · <file name without extension>', the title its credit in a theme's sounds.json. family says how its sounds group on the bench: 'stem', the file name without its trailing number (click_004 → click); 'folder', the folder it lies in. Only CC0 1.0 and CC BY 4.0 are taken: free for F-Droid, CC BY asking only the credit sounds.json gives.",
